一對母女各被刺10多刀慘死，警方日前逮捕女兒前男友，他承認作案。（YouTube@ANNnewsCH）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260502/1127252048036106240309751.jpeg/0ny2sTmW80pLIxxlTrwB7GxI-6eoRKJ_j1taOo9bWjo\"/><figcaption>大阪和泉市一對母女各被刺10多刀慘死，警方日前逮捕女兒前男友，他承認作案。（YouTube@ANNnewsCH）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大阪和泉市一對母女各被刺10多刀慘死，警方日前逮捕女兒前男友，他承認作案。（YouTube@ANNnewsCH）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260502/1127252034395836416065348.jpeg/3a-9VEJhZNrrA33XIh-pbHSoD7MU4F_O8vz-jvL8_o4\"/><figcaption>大阪和泉市一對母女各被刺10多刀慘死，警方日前逮捕女兒前男友，他承認作案。（YouTube@ANNnewsCH）</figcaption></figure><p>有片／台中女駕駛右轉撞腳踏車　17歲男學生噴飛重摔斑馬線上</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T07:04:04.005411+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1978,"images":19,"source":"HK01 中國","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T06:36:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T06:57:25.870594+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T06:57:25.870594+00:00","content_hash":"fcb0100e9c120541ba13271d629a5c2fe379a5809144fbe8f16267e092f48782","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}